flowchart TB
  subgraph Build[Build and runtime]
    Source[React + TypeScript source and npm lockfile] --> Vite[Node 22 / Vite production build]
    Vite --> Static[Static HTML / CSS / JavaScript]
    Static --> Nginx[Unprivileged Nginx :8080 / Docker Compose]
  end
  Nginx --> Browser[Browser / React providers]
  Browser --> Catalog[AnimeCatalog: submitted search, format and states]
  Catalog --> Cards[AnimeCard and score rules]
  Catalog --> Query[TanStack Query: cache, pagination, cancellation]
  Query --> Transport[Typed fetch GraphQL transport and mapping]
  Transport -->|HTTPS POST query + variables| AniList[AniList public GraphQL API]
  AniList -->|data or errors| Transport
  Tests[Vitest + RTL + MSW / Playwright] -. validate .-> Catalog
  Tests -. validate .-> Transport
